---
title: "Session host: one channel across dcserver restarts, host loss and terminate"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Recovery
    lg1: Session
    lg2: Breaks CustodyKept
    lg3: Path to the CustodyKept or HeldInputSubmitted bug
    lg4: Repeats forever, so HeldInputSubmitted breaks
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  class lg4 repeats
  s0: No session
  s1: dcserver down, nothing running
  s2: No session, a message waiting
  s3: Boot reconcile (after the restart)
  s4: No session, input kept for a host, no tmux yet
  s5: No session, input kept for a host
  s6: No session (after the restart)
  s7: No host, input answered
  s8: No session, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s9: No session, input kept for a host (after the restart), no tmux yet
  s10: No session, input kept for a host (after the restart)
  s11: No host, input answered (after the restart)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: dcserver stops
  s0 --> s2: a message arrives
  s1 --> s3: dcserver starts
  s2 --> s4: no host: one notice, the message is kept
  s3 --> s3: a host probe stops failing
  s4 --> s5: tmux becomes usable
  s3 --> s6: intake opens
  s5 --> s7: a host is back: the kept message is queued to run again
  s6 --> s8: a message arrives
  s8 --> s9: no host: one notice, the message is kept
  s9 --> s10: tmux becomes usable
  s10 --> s11: a host is back: the kept message is queued to run again
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 teal
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 blue
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 teal
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 teal
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 teal
  class s6 bugPath
  class s7 teal
  class s7 breaks
  class s7 bugPath
  class s8 teal
  class s8 bugPath
  class s9 teal
  class s9 bugPath
  class s10 teal
  class s10 bugPath
  class s11 teal
  class s11 repeats
